\paragraph{\textbf{Organization of the paper}}
We prove Theorem~\ref{thm:separation} in Section~\ref{sec:deletion}.
Sections~\ref{sec:finite-apps} and~\ref{sec:3d} then prove Theorems~\ref{thm:bk} and~\ref{thm:3d}, respectively.
Section~\ref{sec:further} provides further applications of Theorem~\ref{thm:separation}, including that the three-dimensional long-range LERW in the non-mean-field regime has lower growth exponent at least $3/2$ as well (Proposition~\ref{prop:long-range}).

