\begin{abstract}
    We study whether weak approximability glues along recollements of triangulated categories that are compactly generated by a single object.
    This is applied to derived categories of complexes with quasi-coherent cohomology and prescribed support for quasi-compact quasi-separated algebraic spaces.
\end{abstract}

